<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Gamma sees 20 pct 1996 net growth.</title>
<headline>Dutch Gamma sees 20 pct 1996 net growth.</headline>
<dateline>HELMOND, Netherlands 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch textiles group Gamma said on Tuesday it expected its full year 1996 net profits to show a 20 percent rise on 1995's net.</p>
<p>Net profit in the first half of the current year came to 24.68 million guilders versus a previous 20.23 million.</p>
<p>Total 1995 net was 41.5 million guilders.</p>
<p>&quot;Barring unforeseen circumstances, we expect the full year 1996 net result to be around 20 percent higher than in 1995,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
